## Game AI, in one diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Patrol
    Patrol --> Chase: player spotted
    Chase --> Attack: in range
    Attack --> Chase: out of range
    Chase --> Search: lost sight
    Search --> Patrol: timeout
    Search --> Chase: player spotted
    Attack --> Flee: low health
    Flee --> Patrol: safe
```

